     iiwwnn — Intel IEEE 802.11n wireless network driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, include the following lines in
     your kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn
           ddeevviiccee ppccii
           ddeevviiccee wwllaann
           ddeevviiccee ffiirrmmwwaarree

     You also need to select a firmware for your device.  Choose one from:

           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn11000000ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn110000ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn110055ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn113355ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn22000000ffww
