           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn44996655ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn55000000ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn55115500ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn66000000ffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn66000000gg22aaffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn66000000gg22bbffww
           ddeevviiccee iiwwnn66005500ffww

     Or you can use

           ddeevviiccee iiwwnnffww

     to include them all.

