           iwn5150fw_load="YES"
           iwn6000fw_load="YES"
           iwn6000g2afw_load="YES"
           iwn6000g2bfw_load="YES"
           iwn6050fw_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iiwwnn driver supports ssttaattiioonn and mmoonniittoorr mode operation.  Only one
     virtual interface may be configured at any time.  For more information on
     configuring this device, see ifconfig(8).

     This driver requires the firmware built with the iiwwnnffww module to work.

